=2 Walkthrough
During this Mission, you will have to examine **{p:Seed Fragments|Seed Fragment}** in each zone to receive a level cap status (Level 30). While under the effects of this level cap, you will be able to collect {p:Key Items|Category:Key Items} by touching **{p:Seed Afterglows|Seed Afterglow}**.
* You will not be able to be cured by people who are not under the level cap status, but you will also not lose Experience Points should you die.
** {p:Trust Magic} is not available during this level restriction effect.
* **PRO-TIP**: Use {@i:Destrier Beret|11811} {i:Destrier Beret|Destrier Beret|11811} to trivialize this Mission if you obtained one. The Auto-Reraise and Movement Speed will be applied under the level cap status.
* It is recommended to utilize {@i:Sprinter's Shoes|15754} {i:Sprinter's Shoes|Sprinter's Shoes|15754} for their movement speed buff (18%). You will need to re-apply the buff after you examine the {p:Seed Fragments|Seed Fragment} and receive the level cap when you zone into Middle and Upper Delkfutt's Towers.
* {@i:Prism Powder|4164} {i:Prism Powder|Prism Powder|4164}s and {@i:Silent Oil|4165} {i:Silent Oil|Silent Oil|4165}s are recommended if you solo this, as there can be monsters that aggro by {@a:Magic|Detects by Magic} **Magic** around such as {m:Dolls|Doll} and {p:Elementals|Elemental}.
** **Seed Fragments** tend to be surrounded by monsters that aggro by {@a:Sight|Detects by Sight} **Sight** in most cases, so you'll be forced to drop your invisibility next to the **Seed Fragment** as soon as they are all facing away from you, examine it, and become invisible again as quickly as possible.

=3 Key Items
>**Lower Delkfutt's Tower**
* Examine the **Seed Fragment** on the First Floor (H-10).
** Examine the **Seed Afterglow** on the First Floor (J-10) for the {@k} {k:Amicitia Stone}.
** Take the stairs at **B**. Examine the **Seed Afterglow** on the Second Floor (H-7) for the {@k} {k:Veritas Stone}.
** Take the stairs at **D**. Examine the **Seed Afterglow** on the Third Floor (I-9) for the {@k} {k:Sapientia Stone}.
** Take the (G-6) teleport to Middle Delkfutt's Tower.

>Lower Delkfutt's Tower
