>**Upper Delkfutt's Tower**
* Examine the **Seed Fragment** on the Tenth Floor (F-7).
** Examine the **Seed Afterglow** on the Tenth Floor (F-10) for the {@k} {k:Constantia Stone}.
** Take the stairs. Examine the **Seed Afterglow** on the Eleventh Floor (H-7) for the {@k} {k:Spei Stone}.
** Take the stairs at **B**. Examine the **Seed Afterglow** on the Twelfth Floor (H-7) for the {@k} {k:Salus Stone}.
** Take the (F-10) teleport to {z:Stellar Fulcrum}.
* Examine the **Seed Fragment** in Stellar Fulcrum with all 12 Stone Key Items to receive an {@k} {k:Omnis Stone}.

